;;
;; Substrings are chosen from the RAW response body. Where a name carries
;; non-ASCII characters the raw JSON escapes them (R85P's French name arrives
;; as Soci\u00e9t\u00e9 anonyme), so the gate matches an ASCII name instead.
;; The CBE page splits its address across HTML tags, so the seat is cited via
;; the enterprise number and start date, which survive as contiguous text.
;;
;; Not cited: the entity's own legal page at www.solvay.com. It answered when
;; this repository was created (2026-07-25) and now returns HTTP 403 to
;; automated clients. That is bot protection, which this gate does not attempt
;; to work around, so the page is left out rather than recorded as a citation
;; the gate cannot check. 80-data/public/tos.journal.edn keeps the archived
;; text and its retrieval date.
;;
;; Independent third-party archive. Not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
;; sponsored by SOLVAY.

